Very true. They are all equivalent:

gemini://cookie at mozz.us/beer/
gemini://mozz.us/beer/?cookie
gemini://mozz.us/beer/#cookie
gemini://mozz.us/beer/cookie

Even though, query strings seem to be "special" in gemini, i.e. equivalent to a POST related to 1x (INPUT).

