> On Fri, Jul 17, 2020 at 11:45:28AM -0400, Matthew Graybosch wrote:
> If each  terms after the url  was optional i expect  the specs was
> something like:
>
> =>[<whitespace>]<URL>[<whitespace>][<USER-FRIENDLY LINK NAME>]
