I think we should normalize having to take care of your certificates,
and user agents should provide easy tools for doing so. Certs are much
better than, say, username & password.

If it becomes a problem in practice, perhaps we could do something like
handling certificate resets over email, similar to password resets are
done on the web.

Or you could just get in touch with the owner of the capsule if you get
locked out. Gemini is small and the human touch is still there, and I'll
be happy if we can hold the cold, unfeeling machine-governed
interactions at bay for a bit longer.

