On Wed, 2020-11-25 at 10:10 -0500, John Cowan wrote:
> On Wed, Nov 25, 2020 at 6:32 AM Nick Thomas <gemini at ur.gs> wrote:
> > If it's true for people with an explicit preference, it can also be
