Subject: [SPEC-CHANGE] Mandatory scheme in request and link URLs
Message-ID: <C7FYSG7UY1V1.37JQFPTNE82MG@stilgar>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
MIME-Version: 1.0
