Subject: variable indentation levels / hierarchy in lists
Message-ID: <CAEBBUWgH7Xr8U9jsQsZLjQCD7ai2A1M9Mjp4WMqSpopdT4ueFQ@mail.gmail.com>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
