For Python (a common programming language), this is not true, standard
library's urlparse has no problem:

% ./test-urlparse.py gemini://g?meaux.bortzmeyer.org:8965/caf?\?foo=bar
Host name: g?meaux.bortzmeyer.org
Port: 8965
Path: /caf?
